> in your inventory?  I've never actually tried to blast a bag with a
> wand of cancellation but I can take a wild guess as to what happens.

Your wild guess is wrong.

The only thing a wand of cancellation will do to a bag of holding is to
uncurse it (or unbless it, as the case may be). It will only adversely
affect the bag and everything in it if you're stupid enough to put it
*inside*.

That cancelling a bag of holding will turn it into a sack is a myth. Also,
anything inside a bag is safe from cancellation (again, applied
externally).

